WEBVTT

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:31.131
have a responsibility
or should have a prohibition

00:08:31.173 --> 00:08:34.426
against sponsoring more life
across the universe?

00:08:34.468 --> 00:08:36.303
Do we do this just because we could?

00:08:37.388 --> 00:08:41.392
And what is the ethical difference
and is there any ethical difference

00:08:41.433 --> 00:08:44.603
between spreading a particular Earth life

00:08:44.603 --> 00:08:48.524
versus spreading a potential of life
across the galaxy?

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.151
And where does this difference lie?

00:08:53.112 --> 00:08:57.074
So I really tried
to bring you answers today,

00:08:57.074 --> 00:08:58.325
and I don't have any.

00:08:59.952 --> 00:09:03.122
But I see the facts
shaping in front of me.